  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Anuja Jaiswal\">\n                                                                                            <img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"anuja.jaiswal\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                            <a>Anuja Jaiswal</a>\n                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                 &amp; \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            anuja.jaiswal\n                                                                \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/87654367/TNN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TNN</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Nov 17, 2026 at 03:18 PM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>New Delhi: The <a href=\"/tag/national+medical+commission\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">National Medical Commission</a> (<a href=\"/tag/nmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NMC</a>) has directed all <a href=\"/tag/government+medical+colleges\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">government medical colleges</a> and their attached hospitals across the country to onboard the Centre’s <a href=\"/tag/pm-rahat+scheme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PM-RAHAT scheme</a>, aimed at ensuring <a href=\"/tag/cashless+treatment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">cashless treatment</a> for <a href=\"/tag/road+accident+victims\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">road accident victims</a> during the critical golden hour.In a public notice issued on Monday, the NMC has asked deans, directors, principals and medical superintendents to accord priority to the exercise and take necessary steps to facilitate their institutions’ participation. The move follows a request from the Union Health Ministry’s Trauma and Burn Cell to the commission on October 28 to widen the network of hospitals under the scheme.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M -->\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>The PM-RAHAT (Prime Minister’s Road Accident Victims’ Hospitalisation and Assured Treatment) scheme provides cashless treatment of up to Rs 1.5 lakh per accident victim for a maximum of seven days from the date of the accident at designated hospitals. Non-designated hospitals can provide stabilisation treatment to victims, ensuring that emergency care is not delayed while patients are referred to higher-level facilities.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>The guidelines issued by the National Health Authority (NHA) provide for two categories of hospitals under the scheme: designated hospitals, which can provide stabilisation, trauma and polytrauma services, and PM-RAHAT Lite hospitals, which can provide initial stabilisation before referring patients to higher-level facilities.</p><p>Hospitals empanelled under <a href=\"/tag/ayushman+bharat+pm-jay\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ayushman Bharat PM-JAY</a> will be deemed eligible for designation. Other hospitals can also join, provided they meet the prescribed infrastructure and clinical requirements. These include round-the-clock emergency services, an equipped ICU, emergency operation theatre, imaging facilities, blood storage and ambulance services.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>The guidelines also prioritise hospitals located near accident-prone stretches, including national and state highways, identified road accident hotspots and municipal roads.The scheme was launched by the Prime Minister on February 13, 2026, with the objective of removing financial barriers to <a href=\"/tag/emergency+treatment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">emergency treatment</a> and strengthening <a href=\"/tag/trauma+care\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">trauma care</a> across the country.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Anuja Jaiswal,anuja.jaiswal</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Anuja Jaiswal</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                             &amp; \n                                                                                                                                            <a>anuja.jaiswal</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/87654367/TNN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TNN</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Nov 17, 2026 at 03:18 PM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Nov 17, 2026 at 03:18 PM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download the ETHealthworld App</a> and get the Realtime updates and Save your favourite articles.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                                            <!-- <div class=\"app-store-container desktop-view\">\n                            <a href=\"/app\" title=\"\" aria-label=\"Play Store\">\n                                <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-g-play.png\" alt=\"\" />\n                            </a>\n                      